   defined in Kovalev. The international symbols may be truncated (for format reasons) in
   the table below. The complete international symbols can be found in the previous list.
   Symmetry elements are reduced to the standard form (positive translations < 1) 
   The matrices of IRreps have been multiplied by the appropriate phase factor

